  "description": "The PDF writer for DocWright: a single-pass PDF 1.7 renderer with TrueType and CFF font subsetting, hyperlinks, document outline, accessibility structure and PDF/A-2b output. Deterministic — the same document renders byte-identically every time. Zero dependencies. For reading or rasterizing an existing PDF, see DocWright.Formats.Pdf. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
